-- profile-down --
down-owner
-- remote-unreadable-note --
agentctl could not read Claude Code's session registry (permission denied), so it cannot say whether a running session has Remote Control on. A session that does keeps its claude.ai history only if Remote Control is disconnected there before the swap: decline this swap (answer n, or run without `--yes`), disconnect it there, and run this command again
